Phase 3 (Files 41-57) implements production-grade modules completing
the Apollo-style perception→prediction→planning→control pipeline:

Planning Layer:
- MacroPlanner: desire-weight macro decisions (baron/dragon/group/split)
- LaneAdvisor: early-game lane strategy with matchup awareness

Prediction Layer:
- TeamfightPredictor: 8-factor teamfight outcome model (engage/disengage/poke)

Control Layer:
- OverlayRenderer: TTL-based HUD overlay element manager (max 8 elements)
- ActionDispatcher: unified voice/overlay/log routing with dedup

Perception Layer:
- MinimapAnalyzer: 19-zone map spatial reasoning (lane pressure/jungle control)
- KillFeedAnalyzer: multi-kill, spree, shutdown, ace detection

Infrastructure:
- SharedMemoryTransport: mmap ring buffer for zero-copy large messages
- GameStatistics: rolling window stats (min/max/mean/p95/trend)
- ProtoUtil: JSON/binary serialization with versioned schema
- TrainingDataCollector: SQLite-based training data pipeline
- ConfigLoader: YAML config with env overrides and hot-reload
- DashboardHTML: self-contained real-time monitoring dashboard
- CLIMonitor: terminal ANSI dashboard for operators
- DiagnosticRunner: pipeline health checker

Testing:
- 25/25 Phase 3 tests pass
- 18/18 Phase 1 regression tests pass
